      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{628d00a6b624bb0b622328ef|full_name} This is still required as some languages need to use different form of word depending on what exactly is being public. (at least in Russian, its \"группа\" vs \"групповой\"/\"для группы\" to be clear). \n\nWith this instance types can't be translated, they HAVE TO BE translated, and in exactly the same form as standalone group term.",
