      "value": "@{5f67899159b0841fe0d3891b|full_name}  @{5a9fe9983955314156acc4f7|full_name} This is an interesting case I'd like to hear your thoughts on: so here \"Group\" as the string tied to an instance type is the same context as the notifications category because its not referring to a \"group of people\" directly per say but rather tying it instead to the \"Group\" concept/feature which is required to make that instance type. Any world instance of type \"Group\" is directly linked to a Group itself.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
