      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{628d00a6b624bb0b622328ef|full_name} we need this separation for proper translation. we might not need to translate the instance type. but these words are found in other places in the interface and will look like a blank spot, like an unfinished translation among the translated words.",
